B.azn=new A.c(B.c,["Sichere Verbindung abgelehnt. Ein Virenschutz (z. B. Avast) oder das Netzwerk f\xe4ngt HTTPS-Verbindungen ab. Deaktivieren Sie den HTTPS-Scan des Virenschutzes oder f\xfcgen Sie eine Ausnahme f\xfcr openfoodfacts.org hinzu.","Secure connection refused. An antivirus (for example Avast) or the network is intercepting HTTPS connections. Turn off the antivirus HTTPS scanning or add an exception for openfoodfacts.org.","Connessione sicura rifiutata. Un antivirus (ad esempio Avast) o la rete intercetta le connessioni HTTPS. Disattiva la scansione HTTPS dell\u2019antivirus o aggiungi un\u2019eccezione per openfoodfacts.org.","Conexi\xf3n segura rechazada. Un antivirus (por ejemplo Avast) o la red intercepta las conexiones HTTPS. Desactiva el an\xe1lisis HTTPS del antivirus o a\xf1ade una excepci\xf3n para openfoodfacts.org.","Liga\xe7\xe3o segura recusada. Um antiv\xedrus (por exemplo o Avast) ou a rede interceta as liga\xe7\xf5es HTTPS. Desative a an\xe1lise HTTPS do antiv\xedrus ou adicione uma exce\xe7\xe3o para openfoodfacts.org."],t.w)
